<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>Over 35% of trucks in India run empty, causing an estimated $5 billion in annual losses. Traffic delays cost Indian logistics more than ₹1.47 trillion every year. Better planning can recover much of that.</p></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><h2>Smarter loads</h2></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>We are developing intelligent algorithms that automate load planning. They aim for optimal space utilization, correct weight balance, and better fuel efficiency on every trip, so fewer trucks travel half-empty.</p></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><h2>Routes that adapt</h2></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>Our AI models will also manage dynamic route planning based on real-time traffic, road conditions, and delivery priorities. When conditions change, routes change with them, helping fleets reduce delays and operational costs.</p></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>Together, real-time tracking, automated load balancing, and route optimization can reduce fuel and time wastage by up to 20%. These capabilities sit inside the operations and TMS modules of Next Fleet.</p></div>
